A knight can jump into and out of the castle, if the drawbridge is
destroyed; this would require lining up with someone with a wand of
striking. When all but one trapdoor are plugged, it takes only a little
bit of patience to cross the back corridor. A knight can also jump across
one Medusa level (sometimes jumping into the water just one tile beyond an
island and crawling onto land). For the other Medusa level, you would need
to wait for someone with a wand of cold to freeze water.

(I once had no means to cross the water at the castle's drawbridge. A
soldier with a wand of cold froze the water for me, and luckily I got
inside before someone evaporated the ice.)

